  "notes": "Used for machines, factories, power plants, IT systems, and other equipment. The noun form {稼働|かどう} is common in compound expressions.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {稼働|かどう}{率|りつ}: operation rate, utilization rate\n- {稼働|かどう}{時間|じかん}: operating hours\n- {稼働|かどう}{日|び}: working day, operational day\n- フル{稼働|かどう}: full operation, running at full capacity\n- {稼働|かどう}{中|ちゅう}: in operation, currently running\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {動|うご}く: to move, to work — everyday word for things functioning\n- {運転|うんてん}する: to operate — used for vehicles and large machinery\n- {稼働|かどう}する: to be in operation — technical, used for systems and industrial equipment",
